// `Predicate.Shares` under Lean's own name for it: the alias
// `declare_semantic_primitives` generates, so a card writes a macro where the
// basis has a constructor (ADR 12.1). Sharing: at least one value in common on
// the axis (`Share`) or none (`Differ`) [CR#201.2a,201.2c,105.2,205.3m]; on the
// name axis it is not equality.
(
    name: "shares",
    kinds: [Predicate],
    params: {"axis": Any, "agreement": Any, "with": Subject},
    body: Shares(axis: Param(axis), agreement: Param(agreement), with: Param(with)),
)
